SIM-15: reject a PRESSURE EXPONENT of 0 in [OPTIONS]

optionvalue() rejected only negative pressure exponents. With 0 the
demand functions use n = 1/0, NaN reaches the solution matrix, and the
run returns 0 with NaN heads, flows and demands. Reject values <= 0
with error 213, as EN_setdemandmodel does (error 208).

Apply from the root of an EPANET checkout at 83e25bb:
    git apply SIM-15_fix.patch

diff --git a/src/input3.c b/src/input3.c
index e97110f..7f15088 100644
--- a/src/input3.c
+++ b/src/input3.c
@@ -2153,7 +2153,7 @@ int optionvalue(Project *pr, int n)
     }
     else if (match(tok0, w_PRESSURE))
     {
-        if (y < 0.0) return setError(parser, nvalue, 213);
+        if (y <= 0.0) return setError(parser, nvalue, 213);
         hyd->Pexp = y;
         return 0;
     }
